```', '{"A":"[5]","B":"[2, 5]","C":"[]","D":"[2, 2, 5]"}', 'B', NULL, 'Forward removal with `i++` **skips** the element shifted into the removed slot. Trace from `[2,2,2,5]`: i=0 remove → `[2,2,5]` (i→1); i=1 element is `2` remove → `[2,5]` (i→2); i=2 size is 2 so the loop ends. Left with `[2,5]` — two `2`s survived. (The classic skip bug; reverse iteration would fix it.)', NULL, NULL, NULL),
